        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 6030, Trenton Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Trenton Entry Door Lockset is perfect for those beachside abodes, bringing elegance and softness to ornate hardware for traditional homes. Whether you live on Millionaire Mile or somewhere a bit more landlocked, this FancyTrenton Entry Door Lockset will add beauty to your front door. The Trenton Lockset is available in single cylinder, interconnected single cylinder, or dummy functions. It will fit standard 2-1/8 inch door preparations with door thicknesses ranging from 1-5/8 inches to - 2-3/4 inches thick and with backsets of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Choose from a wide array of perfectly matched levers and knobs to really customize your traditional handleset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fancy Trenton Entry Door Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass latch with saw-proof insert.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Trenton Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 10-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bore Hole Spacing (distance between deadbolt and lever latch): 5-1/2\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 2-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: 1-5/8\" - 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" Throw</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-6030-specifications.pdf?v=1704262347\"><b>Emtek 6030 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a knob/lever operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n<li><b>Interconnected Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn from the interior. The interior knob/lever opens the door without having to unlock the deadbolt for immediate egress.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-6030-finish.jpg?v=1704442284\" width=\"600\" height=\"115\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek 6030 Available Finishes\">\r\n</p>",
